@startuml
title L2-036 - Separate demo and live integrations honestly
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

actor "Library owner" as actor
box "Frontend - Loupe application / domain / api" #E0F2FE
participant "CapabilityNotice" as page
participant "CapabilityService" as client
end box
box "Backend - Loupe API application" #D1FADF
participant "CapabilitiesController" as controller
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
participant "GetCapabilitiesQueryHandler" as handler
participant "CapabilityState" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
database "Library store" as db
end box
actor -> page : Separate demo and live integrations honestly
page -> client : none
client -> controller : GET /api/capabilities
note over controller : API middleware authenticates; controller binds only
controller -> handler : MediatR dispatch GetCapabilitiesQuery
handler -> db : Load / validate owner-scoped state before side effects
db --> handler : Owned state or unavailable result
handler -> entity : Resolve explicit Demo or Live configuration [L2-036]
alt Demo
entity --> handler : Deterministic simulated adapters; no AI traffic
else Live missing credentials
entity --> handler : Integration not configured; manual actions available
else configured Live
entity --> handler : Real provider capabilities; no mock substitution
end
note over db : Saved output and vectors retain original mode
handler --> controller : safe mode/disclosure; Demo output / Demo search labels
controller --> client : Typed HTTP response / ProblemDetails
client --> page : Update state signals
page --> actor : Saved / loaded state or retained-input error
@enduml
